==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪnt}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|linet|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|fro}} {{term|linette||grain of flax|lang=fro}}, diminutive of {{term|lin||flax|lang=fro}}; or, from {{etyl|Medieval Latin}} {{term|linteum|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|linum|līnum|flax|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# a [[fine]] [[material]] made by [[scraping]] [[cotton]] or [[linen]] [[cloth]]; used for [[dressing]] [[wound]]s
# [[clinging]] [[fuzzy]] [[fluff]] that [[accumulate]]s in one's [[pocket]]s or [[navel]] etc
# the [[fibrous]] [[coat]] of thick [[hair]]s covering the [[seed]]s of the [[cotton]] [[plant]]

